## Upgrade Guide

{% if version %}

Download or update to {{ version }}:

[![Download](https://img.shields.io/badge/DOWNLOAD-LATEST_RELEASE-2563eb?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/Armoghans-Organization/Omarchy-Tweaker/releases/tag/{{ version }})

{% else %}

This version is still under development. Wait for an official
release before treating these changes as a stable release.

{% endif %}

Before upgrading:

1. Review the release notes and breaking changes.
2. Check whether your existing configuration needs migration.
3. Review the installation and setup instructions.
4. Back up any important custom configuration.
5. Pull the latest changes and re-run the setup steps.

